{"agent_id":"pp3g-Ij1J-phase-1-pre-positioned-auditor-in-flight-divergence","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:15:46.617241428Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"49266c99-4085-4339-bf60-348c92add444","comment_uuid":"1a44fa3e-478a-4785-b220-c5405aa4e5d0","author":"pp3g-Ij1J-phase-1-pre-positioned-auditor-in-flight-divergence","content":"Plan (Phase-1 pre-positioned AUDITOR, read-only, flag-only): (1) Establish a pre-Builder artifact/position BASELINE so later 'advance' claims are measurable: builder=pp3g-VAPd, agent-branch last ref 18:09:31Z, feature/pp3g-VAPd-... still at the 07:53:34Z worktree-creation base (zero feature commits), #295 has ZERO comments, and research/toolregistry-lazy-mcp/catalog-scale/ does NOT exist. (2) Build an independent re-derivation basis BEFORE the Builder emits claims — read the existing lazy proxy/backend harness that #295 says will be reused, so I can check Test-1 backend_spawn_count==0 and proxy-vs-backend residency semantics against the mechanism rather than against the Builder's narration (fast-completion lesson: a wrong-but-fast builder is only caught by independent re-derivation). (3) Poll the trigger set on a bounded cadence: position/heartbeat staleness (>2x the ~10-15min cadence), position-vs-artifact mismatch, reviewer disagreement, orchestrator request. Liveness is confirmed via lock + agent-branch refs + artifacts BEFORE any absence call (PVi7), and staleness is NOT raised while artifacts advance (WZSE). (4) Per-checkpoint verification targets, each bounded ~5-10min: Test 1 backend_spawn_count==0 (or an explicit stop-and-flag); data tables reporting proxy and backend residency SEPARATELY with mode (sequential/concurrent) + teardown (off/on) per row; daemon-thread count + sync/async calling mode + pinned versions recorded; Test 4's '17 refreshed-but-never-called' row present and stating residency; Test 5 CHARACTERIZED not fixed; report.md carrying the one-sentence N-vs-K scaling conclusion + a Strong/Conditional/Fail architectural conclusion. (5) On any trigger: post claim / evidence / divergence to #299 and flag the Orchestrator. I do not fix, dispatch, or write files. Phase 2 post-hoc audit is a separate later dispatch, not mine.","created_at":"2026-08-08T18:15:46.611062277Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:Rj4INtResnauuPj2uF3Yb3Z0661Knv1vbBrWaPMatDU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgbqNUl2DRFUC4HFd7UeMGWePiPjIHsXIxnoRNVkc9JD8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA4L5CDjt8SSTPKvvjoQQ039afFI95818UdxhBdzj3R91IH488XxZnjZi9w79UmtFbfBHEliArbzb2YbaMEnltBw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:Rj4INtResnauuPj2uF3Yb3Z0661Knv1vbBrWaPMatDU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgbqNUl2DRFUC4HFd7UeMGWePiPjIHsXIxnoRNVkc9JD8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHcjaHCrJGfRjKGBMT924m378RurGS9uSrt3PpwKkiT3p7gpiFb5VS4sduPSgkS8T8xpXAXeNOPuaAwQJ/EuUg4="}
